  "description": "Lightweight and Portable Design\n\nAt just 18 kg, the BK35S is designed for easy carrying and storage. Its compact folding frame fits perfectly into your car boot, public transport, or even under your desk—ideal for commuters and city explorers.\nRemovable Long-Lasting Battery\n\nThe 36V 9Ah (324Wh) lithium battery delivers a reliable 35–70km range per charge, depending on riding conditions. With its removable design, recharging is simple and secure wherever you are.\nSmart Display with App Connectivity\nStay in control with the S869 full-colour LCD display, showing speed, mileage, and battery at a glance. Connect to the HITWAY App via Bluetooth to unlock features like ride tracking, performance monitoring, and system diagnostics.\nDurable Aluminium Frame\n\nMade from strong aluminium alloy, the BK35S combines long-lasting durability with a sleek, modern black-and-white design that turns heads on city streets and cycle paths.\nReliable Braking and Smooth Assist\nThe intelligent 3-level pedal assist system ensures smooth, consistent support for commuting or leisure, while front and rear disc brakes with electronic braking provide responsive stopping power in all weather conditions.",
